{
  "id": "vp.oidf.dcapi.basic.001",
  "description": "The Digital Credentials API channel (OpenID4VP 1.0 \u00a78.4): the wallet never POSTs its answer back \u2014 the flow completes with the DigitalCredential's data (the plain response object for dc_api), and the caller's actual origin, validated against the request's expected_origins, rides the presentation ask for the KB-JWT's aud.",
  "provenance": "oidf",
  "generator": {
    "repo": "sirosfoundation/siros-wallet-core",
    "commit": "88747a34234d6dda7886062bc7c817b68593b887",
    "date": "2026-11-09"
  },
  "spec_refs": [
    "OpenID4VP 1.0 section 8.4 (the Digital Credentials API response modes: the response returns through the browser, never a wallet-side POST)",
    "OpenID4VP 1.0 section 5.1 (expected_origins: the verifier page's origins the request binds to)",
    "HAIP-1.0 section 7.3.2 (the KB-JWT's aud on the DC API channel: the origin)"
  ],
  "setup": {
    "time": 1700000000,
    "entropy_seed": 42,
    "pdp": {
      "trusted": true,
      "decision": "in the registry"
    }
  },
  "script": [
    {
      "wmp_in": {
        "method": "wmp.flow.start",
        "params": {
          "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-001",
          "flow_type": "oid4vp",
          "params": {
            "client_id": "https://verifier.example",
            "nonce": "nonce-dcapi-001",
            "response_mode": "dc_api",
            "response_type": "vp_token",
            "expected_origins": [
              "https://verifier.example"
            ],
            "origin": "https://verifier.example",
            "dcql_query": {
              "credentials": [
                {
                  "id": "pid-query",
                  "format": "dc+sd-jwt",
                  "meta": {
                    "vct_values": [
                      "urn:eudi:pid:1"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "host_ask": {
        "expect": {
          "kind": "match"
        },
        "answer": {
          "value": {
            "selections": [
              {
                "credential_query_id": "pid-query",
                "credential_id": "cred-pid-1",
                "disclosed_claims": [
                  "[\"given_name\"]"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "host_ask": {
        "expect": {
          "kind": "consent"
        },
        "answer": {
          "value": {
            "consented": true
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "host_ask": {
        "expect": {
          "kind": "presentation",
          "inputs": {
            "origin": "https://verifier.example"
          }
        },
        "answer": {
          "value": {
            "vp_token": "vp-token-dcapi-001"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "http_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "https://verifier.example/*",
          "purpose": "DirectPost",
          "must_refuse": true
        },
        "reply": {
          "status": 200,
          "body": {}
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-001",
            "step": "parsing_request"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-001",
            "step": "request_parsed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-001",
            "step": "evaluating_verifier_trust"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-001",
            "step": "trust_evaluated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-001",
            "step": "transaction_data_validated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-001",
            "step": "credential_selection"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-001",
            "step": "submitting_response"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-001",
            "step": "response_returned"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.complete",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-001",
            "result": {
              "presented": true,
              "credential_ids": [
                "cred-pid-1"
              ],
              "dc_api_response": {
                "vp_token": "{\"pid-query\":[\"vp-token-dcapi-001\"]}"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Suite-validated on 2026-11-09: the OIDF OID4VP HAIP wallet plan's dc_api module group (oid4vp-1final-wallet-haip-test-plan, sd_jwt_vc / eudi_pid / x509_hash / dc_api.jwt / request_uri_signed) green against the engine through the mini-wallet \u2014 11 modules PASSED, the eight negatives REVIEW (plan t8zTXhIGHDy25, suite 5.3.4; the evidence is archived in siros-conformance/results/mini-wallet-vp-dcapi/2026-11-09/ and on the Pages site under runs/mini-wallet-vp-dcapi-2026-11-09). The vector uses the plain by-value form \u2014 the suite's request is a signed JWT carried inside the browser API's {digital: {requests: [...]}} payload, but the \u00a78.4 semantics this pins are post-parse: no wallet-side POST, the completion carrying the DigitalCredential's data, and the actual origin (the transport's input) riding the presentation ask. The suite's own page posts {data, protocol} to the module's browser API submit URL \u2014 the harness plays that role."
}
